Jonas wasn't.

238
00:19:23,662 --> 00:19:27,448
Responsible.
No. If that's the case, then

239
00:19:27,532 --> 00:19:29,050
who was it that attacked you?

240
00:19:29,350 --> 00:19:32,920
Sammy did. Jonas was the one
who went to find some help.

241
00:19:33,730 --> 00:19:36,568
But it was Sammy and his
friends who informed me of it.

242
00:19:36,652 --> 00:19:38,710
That's the reason I came here.

243
00:19:39,460 --> 00:19:42,418
Is that true?
Why would someone report

244
00:19:42,502 --> 00:19:44,158
a crime they
had committed themselves?

245
00:19:44,272 --> 00:19:45,628
I know what happened to you was

246
00:19:45,712 --> 00:19:48,418
unpleasant,
but something shouldn't be said.

247
00:19:48,532 --> 00:19:51,448
What? Sammy's worked
here since he was 12.

248
00:19:51,532 --> 00:19:53,848
He's practically been
an artisan since birth.

249
00:19:53,932 --> 00:19:55,780
He's one of my best charges.

250
00:19:56,140 --> 00:19:58,108
I know that he would
never lie to me.

251
00:19:58,192 --> 00:20:01,558
Sorry, but he did. In fact,
right before it happened,

252
00:20:01,642 --> 00:20:03,178
Jonas came by here on an errand.

253
00:20:03,262 --> 00:20:04,888
He said that Sammy
told him you wanted

254
00:20:04,972 --> 00:20:07,498
an to go to the work area.
Does that sound familiar?

255
00:20:07,582 --> 00:20:11,668
Silence that fairy now. After that,
he came back looking terrified.

256
00:20:11,752 --> 00:20:16,220
Shut your mouth. Refused.
That's it. Please stop it.

257
00:20:19,956 --> 00:20:20,824
Oh, shall.

258
00:20:21,500 --> 00:20:24,608
You're the fairy who served
as model for Keith's entry.

259
00:20:24,692 --> 00:20:26,768
The one who came
to Halford's rescue.

260
00:20:26,882 --> 00:20:29,960
Tell me then,
who's to blame for this?

261
00:20:30,440 --> 00:20:36,050
Most rotten apples tend to fall
from a rotten tree. Huh? Huh?

262
00:20:37,010 --> 00:20:42,868
Huh? Then get out. You, Jonas.
Your fairies, the lot of you.

263
00:20:42,982 --> 00:20:44,998
You're free to take
the peace that you made

264
00:20:45,082 --> 00:20:47,530
in the three barrels
of sugar that you were fined.

265
00:20:47,680 --> 00:20:51,820
Think of it as the workshop's compensation
for the inconvenience you suffered.

266
00:20:52,410 --> 00:20:56,620
But, sir, that's not fair.
I said leave.

